{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04291","headline":"宴龙泓 · 武三思","name":"宴龙泓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登临开胜托，眺瞩尽良游。\n岩崿萦纡上，澄潭屈曲流。\n泛兰清兴洽，折桂野文遒。\n别後相思处，崎岖碧涧幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武三思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}